%rec: shrine
# objects.rec: D1's dungeon objects as the game shows them. Three sections:
# %rec: shrine, D1's shrines in shrine order (the index is the shrine's kind); 26 records, or Hellfire's count:
#   name / message    the shrine's name and what it says when used
#   max_lvl           the deepest dungeon level it may appear on
#   avail             2: multiplayer only, so it never appears here; any other value: it may appear
# %rec: storybook, the story books' titles, indexed by the book's number
#   name              the title
# %rec: object, how an object (by xl_obj.txt's OBJ_ id) is named and lit:
#   id                OBJ_ name; required
#   name              its shown name (objects without a record are nameless decoration)
#   light             the radius it glows with; wall_light true: a decorative light D1 hangs itself
#   container         true: it is looted (it may hold nothing)
#   sfx               sfx.rec id it plays when used
#
# D1's 26 shrines (shrinestrs and their MsgStrings), in shrine order: the index is the shrine's Var1.
# max_lvl is D1's shrineMax, the deepest dungeon level the shrine may be generated on; avail is shrineAvail,
# where 2 means multiplayer only and so never appears in this game.

name: Mysterious
message: Some are weakened as one grows strong (-1 all stats, +6 to one random stat permanently)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Hidden
message: New strength is forged through destruction (+10 max durability on equipped items, one random item -20)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Gloomy
message: Those who defend seldom attack (+2 armor on all armor, -1 max damage on all weapons)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 1

name: Weird
message: The sword of justice is swift and sharp (+1 max damage on all weapons)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 1

name: Magical
message: While the spirit is vigilant the body thrives (Mana Shield)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Stone
message: The powers of mana refocused renews (recharges all staves)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Religious
message: Time cannot diminish the power of steel (repairs all items)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Enchanted
message: Magic is not always what it seems to be (+1 level to known spells, -2 to one random spell)
max_lvl: 8
avail: 0

name: Thaumaturgic
message: What once was opened now is closed (refills all chests on this level)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 1

name: Fascinating
message: Intensity comes at the cost of wisdom (+2 Firebolt levels, -10% max mana permanently)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Cryptic
message: Arcane power brings destruction (casts Nova, restores mana)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Magical
message: While the spirit is vigilant the body thrives (Mana Shield)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Eldritch
message: Crimson and Azure become as the sun (healing and mana potions in pack become rejuvenation)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Eerie
message: Knowledge and wisdom at the cost of self (+2 Mag permanently)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Divine
message: Drink and be refreshed (full life and mana, drops 2 potions)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Holy
message: Wherever you go, there you are (teleports you to a random spot)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Sacred
message: Energy comes at the cost of wisdom (+2 Charged Bolt levels, -10% max mana permanently)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Spiritual
message: Riches abound when least expected (fills empty inventory slots with gold)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Spooky
message: Where avarice fails, patience gains reward (no effect in single player)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 2

name: Abandoned
message: The hands of men may be guided by fate (+2 Dex permanently)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Creepy
message: Strength is bolstered by heavenly faith (+2 Str permanently)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Quiet
message: The essence of life flows from within (+2 Vit permanently)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Secluded
message: The way is made clear when viewed from above (reveals the level map)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Ornate
message: Salvation comes at the cost of wisdom (+2 Holy Bolt levels, -10% max mana permanently)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Glimmering
message: Mysteries are revealed in the light of reason (identifies all items)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 0

name: Tainted
message: Those who are last may yet be first (no effect in single player)
max_lvl: 16
avail: 2

